### Kreiraj kategoriju
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Temelji",
  "plannedBudget": 15000
}

### Dohvati sve kategorije
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### Kreiraj subkategoriju (promijeni categoryId prema ID-u iz odgovora gore)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/subcategories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "Iskop",
  "plannedBudget": 3000
}

### Kreiraj expense
POST http://localhost:8080/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "subcategoryId": 1,
  "name": "Bager za iskop",
  "amount": 2800,
  "date": "2026-08-14",
  "status": "PAID",
  "vendor": "Iskopi d.o.o.",
  "note": "3 dana rada"
}

### Dohvati sve expense-e
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses

### Dohvati expense-e po kategoriji
GET http://localhost:8080/api/expenses?categoryId=1

### Update kategorije
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Temelji i iskop",
  "plannedBudget": 16000
}

### Obriši expense
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/expenses/1
